{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}}\f0\fs20 Only Torrent\par\par
Only Torrent is open-source software. The complete LICENSE and third-party license notices are included in the installation folder.\par\par
This installer installs application files only. User settings, tasks, resume data and managed torrent files remain in the user's Only Torrent profile. Profiles are kept by default when uninstalling. The Windows uninstall dialog allows explicit cleanup of the current user's profile or all user profiles after successful application removal. Downloaded files and other documents are preserved.\par}
